# Review ownership. A pull request touching a path here needs approval from the listed
# owner in addition to the general review requirement.
#
# These are GitHub teams, not individuals. A team survives someone leaving; a username
# does not, and a CODEOWNERS file full of departed maintainers silently stops working.
# Personal email addresses are deliberately absent — this repository is public.
#
# SETUP REQUIRED: create these teams in the DTC-Consortium organization and give each
# write access to this repository. Until they exist, GitHub cannot assign reviewers and
# "require code owner review" will block every pull request.

